  9   4010              ; Four balls walk a pixel a frame, one towards each wall of the room; before
 10   4010              ; each step walled is asked about the next place.
 11   4010              stat    EQU VARS                ; the status the interrupt routine read
 12   4010              ticks   EQU VARS + 1            ; frames, two bytes
 13   4010              names   EQU $C400               ; the copy of the 768 names
