179   41A9              ; 16 x 16 pixels: the cells from column X / 8 to (X + 15) / 8 and from row
180   41A9              ; (Y + 1) / 8 to (Y + 16) / 8, for a sprite's first line is Y + 1 (chapter
181   41A9              ; 26). A name that is not 0 is a wall. Uses A, BC, DE, HL
